			<item>
				<title>Folk</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/folk/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/folk/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;background&#34;&gt;Background&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Something to know about me, I was not always a software developer, long before that my passion in music and culture was a pillar in my identity. This passion arrived when my sister first introduced me to the local folklore group &amp;ldquo;Os Moleiros da Ribeira&amp;rdquo;, this was about 20 years ago in 2006, when I was about 8 years old. At this age I was already playing the accordion for 2 years and already had a bit of a passion for music, being part of the group only enhanced it. Funny enough, I only started playing the instrument in the group about 3 years ago, all this time I was dancing in the group.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>A Barca Virou</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-a_barca_virou/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-a_barca_virou/</guid>
				<description>&lt;iframe src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/A Barca Virou_versao-simplificada.pdf&#34; width=&#34;600px&#34; height=&#34;900px&#34; style=&#34;border: none; border-radius: 8px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/A Barca Virou_versao-simplificada.pdf&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(mulher)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;A barca virou&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Deixa-la virar&lt;br&gt;&#xA;São voltas que dão&lt;br&gt;&#xA;No fundo do mar&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CORO – repetir quadra&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Ó compadre tombou um carro&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Lá para as bandas de São Mateus&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Ó comadre eu vou-me embora&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Ó compadre adeus adeus&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(mulher)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Tombou ai lé&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Deixa-la tombar&lt;br&gt;&#xA;São voltas que dão&lt;br&gt;&#xA;E tornam a dar&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;details&gt;&#xA;&lt;summary&gt;Show English translation&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(woman)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;The little boat turned over&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Let her turn&lt;br&gt;&#xA;They are turns that take place&lt;br&gt;&#xA;at the bottom of the sea&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
